      "statusChangeNewStatus": "tracked",
      "value": "This is a known issue! We put this out recently on our Discord (because we don't have an in-game news system yet 😢)\nWe are aware and actively investigating an emerging issue with the Oculus Quest 1 (not Quest 2) microphone not working in VRChat. \nOur initial findings show that updating the Quest OS to version 27 may be causing this issue to happen. You may want to defer system updates for the time being to ensure the microphone stays functional. \nWe will continue to investigate and update again when we have more info. Thank you!",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
