  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The mic is not working for quest user in vrchat. \n1. I tried the settings, everything should work nothing is muted and the mic sign isnt blocked.\n2. I tried the safety options, I allowed everything I could on my quest for green and orange rank but nothing works.\n3. I tried your workaround to uninstall the app and close the game to open it back and re-installing it on but didn't work.\n4. I then tried to play on my pc with the same account and it worked but only on desktop so it has to be a Quest problem.\n5. I reset the quest to Factory mode thinking it might fix it but no, nothing, when I tried it the quest wont catch my voice when I speak I can see the mic icon being open but it doesn't catch my voice.\nPlease fix this, I want to have a party with my cousin this week and I wish to be able to talk with him. thank you for your time. If it help it started to do that when I was loading in and the storage was busted, a message said to uninstall a few apps to create space, so I did and that's when it started (not sure if this is the cause) there was also this huge avatar that made me crash when I cloned it and then I closed the game until the next morning.(not sure if this is the cause either)",
